  "If hand tracking gestures are annoying, you can disable them in \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Hand tracking interaction\". Alternatively, you can enable \"Hand tracking interaction\"->\"Only touch\".": "如果手部追踪手势烦人，您可以在“头显”->“手柄”->“手部追踪交互”中禁用它。或者启用“手部追踪交互”->“仅触摸”。",
  "If on_connect.bat exists alongside session.json, it will be run on headset connect. Env var ACTION will be set to `connect`.": "如果 on_connect.bat 与 session.json 位于同一目录，头显连接时将运行它。环境变量 ACTION 将设置为 `connect`。",
  "If on_connect.sh exists alongside session.json, it will be run on headset connect. Env var ACTION will be set to `connect`.": "如果 on_connect.sh 与 session.json 位于同一目录，头显连接时将运行它。环境变量 ACTION 将设置为 `connect`。",
  "If on_disconnect.bat exists alongside session.json, it will be run on headset disconnect. Env var ACTION will be set to `disconnect`.": "如果 on_disconnect.bat 与 session.json 位于同一目录，头显断开时将运行它。环境变量 ACTION 将设置为 `disconnect`。",
  "If on_disconnect.sh exists alongside session.json, it will be run on headset disconnect. Env var ACTION will be set to `disconnect`.": "如果 on_disconnect.sh 与 session.json 位于同一目录，头显断开时将运行它。环境变量 ACTION 将设置为 `disconnect`。",
  "If the client has no preference, enables compositing VR layers to an RGBA float16 framebuffer, and doing sRGB/YUV conversions in shader code.": "如果客户端没有偏好，启用将 VR 图层合成到 RGBA float16 帧缓冲区，并在着色器代码中执行 sRGB/YUV 转换。",
  "If the framerate changes more than this factor, trigger a parameters update": "如果帧率变化超过该倍数，则触发参数更新",
  "If the visual controller/hand models do not match the physical controller's position, you can tweak the offset in \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Left controller position/rotation offset\" (affects both controllers).": "如果手柄/手部的视觉模型与实际手柄位置不匹配，您可以调整“头显”->“手柄”->“左手柄位置/旋转偏移”（影响双手柄）。",
  "If trackers have not been calibrated before, the calibration process will start after you connect to the streamer.": "如果追踪器之前未校准，连接串流端后校准过程将开始。",
  "If you experience \"white snow\" flickering, set \"Presets\"->\"Resolution\" to \"Low\" and disable \"Video\"->\"Foveated encoding\".": "如果出现“白雪花”闪烁，请将“预设”->“分辨率”设为“低”，并禁用“视频”->“注视点编码”。",
  "If you have problems syncing external controllers or trackers to ALVR tracking space, add one element to \"Headset\"->\"Extra OpenVR properties\", then set a custom \"Tracking system name string\".": "如果无法将外部手柄或追踪器同步到 ALVR 追踪空间，请在“头显”->“额外 OpenVR 属性”中添加一个元素，然后设置自定义的“追踪系统名称字符串”。",
  "If you often experience image glitching, you can trade that with stutter frames using \"Connection\"->\"Avoid video glitching\".": "如果您经常遇到图像花屏，可以通过“连接”->“避免视频花屏”来换取卡顿帧。",
  "If you started having crashes after changing some settings, reset ALVR by re-running \"Run setup wizard\" from the \"Installation\" tab and clicking \"Reset settings\".": "如果在更改某些设置后开始崩溃，请从“安装”标签页重新运行“运行设置向导”并点击“重置设置”来重置 ALVR。",
  "If you want to share a video recording for reporting a bug, you can enable \"Extra\"->\"Capture\"->\"Rolling video files\" to limit the file size of the upload.": "如果您想分享视频录制来报告 bug，可以启用“额外”->“捕获”->“滚动视频文件”来限制上传文件大小。",
  "If you're using an NVIDIA GPU, it's best to use high-bitrate H264; if you're using an AMD GPU, HEVC might look better.": "如果您使用 NVIDIA GPU，最好使用高码率 H264；如果使用 AMD GPU，HEVC 可能效果更好。",
  "If your headset does not appear in the device list, it might be in a different subnet. Try \"Add device manually\" with IP shown from inside device.": "如果您的头显没有出现在设备列表中，它可能在不同的子网中。请尝试使用头显内显示的 IP“手动添加设备”。",
  "Image corruption fix": "图像损坏修复",
  "Improve clarity of high contrast edges and counteract blur.\nUseful when the input resolution is low compared to the headset display": "提高高对比度边缘的清晰度并抵消模糊。\n当输入分辨率低于头显显示分辨率时很有用",
  "Improves accuracy of the tracking at the cost of higher latency.": "以提高延迟为代价来提高追踪精度。",
  "Improves visual quality by using the edge direction to upscale at a slight performance loss": "利用边缘方向进行超分辨率以改善视觉质量，代价是轻微的性能损失",
  "In case you want to report a bug and share your log, you should enable \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Prefer backtrace\".": "如果要报告 bug 并分享日志，您应该启用“额外”->“日志”->“优先使用回溯”。",
  "In case you want to report a bug, to get a log file, enable \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Log to disk\". The log will be inside \"session_log.txt\".": "如果要报告 bug，请启用“额外”->“日志”->“写入日志到磁盘”以获取日志文件。日志将保存在“session_log.txt”中。",
  "Increasing \"Video\"->\"Color correction\"->\"Sharpness\" may improve the perceived image quality.": "增大“视频”->“色彩校正”->“锐度”可以改善感知到的图像质量。",
  "Increasing \"Video\"->\"Maximum buffering\" may reduce stutters at the cost of more latency.": "增大“视频”->“最大缓冲”可以减少卡顿，但会增加延迟。",
  "Increasing this value will help reduce stutter but it will increase latency": "增大此值有助于减少卡顿，但会增加延迟",
  "Initial calculated throughput": "初始计算吞吐量",
  "Insert IDR": "插入 IDR",
