  "Whenever possible, attempts to use this profile. May increase compatibility with varying mobile devices. Only has an effect for h264. Doesn't affect NVENC on Windows.": "尽可能尝试使用此配置文件。可以提高与不同移动设备的兼容性。仅对 h264 有效。不影响 Windows 上的 NVENC。",
